  "_comment": "Per-machine source paths for the separate-repo plugin apps. Copy this file to scripts/apps.local.json (gitignored) and edit. Keys are app slugs; values are the web-UI source directory (or the index.html file, for vane). '~' expands to your home dir. Only override the apps you actually have checked out — missing ones are skipped.",
